{"id":"o-tampabayfishingtrips-com","title":"Bay Reef Fishing Charters","cat":"water","art":"fishing","area":"St. Petersburg, FL","metroId":"tampa","src":"tampabayfishingtrips.com","rating":5,"reviews":186,"specs":[],"options":[{"name":"Fishing charter","detail":"2 hours","price":375},{"name":"Fishing charter","detail":"3 hours","price":450},{"name":"Fishing charter","detail":"4 hours","price":600},{"name":"Fishing charter","detail":"6 hours","price":900}],"services":[{"name":"Fishing charter","desc":"Everything needed for fishing is covered including licenses, rods, reels, tackle, bait, and ice. The Captain will filet, ice and bag your catch for you! Several nearby seafood restaurants will cook your catch for you anyway you like for the ultimate Hook and Cook experience! On a backcounty sport fishing trip we are typically in 1-5 ft of water on shallow grass flats. We quietly troll into the mangroves where we target Snook, Redfish, Spotted Sea Trout, Black Drum, Flounder, Mackerel and Tarpon. On the Tampa Bay inshore reef trip we fish in 20-50ft of water dropping down on Tampa Bays reefs and in the deep water shipping channel. Here we target Red Grouper, Gag Grouper, Mangrove Snapper,","photo":"https://www.tampabayfishingtrips.com/quality_auto/481506864_934617435504768_7365019823226218732_n.jpg","variants":[{"label":"2 hours","price":375,"optionIdx":0},{"label":"3 hours","price":450,"optionIdx":1},{"label":"4 hours","price":600,"optionIdx":2},{"label":"6 hours","price":900,"optionIdx":3}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","blurb":"Book a family-friendly charter fishing trip in St. Petersburg GL with Capt. Dmitri and Bay Reef Charters. See available trips, pricing and book","cover":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/95e38a_701f5cc513e844b5bc1151a014bdfdfd~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_160,h_134,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/95e38a_701f5cc513e844b5bc1151a014bdfdfd~mv